    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123170/extras/b23af9ab28314d659ccd5c8b818ab215.avif?t=1729531521\" width=590 height=234 /></span><br><br><strong>Dive into a world of cheese and challenges! Help a cunning mouse escape an elaborate maze filled with secret passages, dangerous traps and intriguing puzzles. Each level is a new challenge, requiring you to use your wits to guide the rodent to the delicious prize: an irresistible piece of cheese. Explore different environments, from ancient forests to entire worlds made of cheese, each with its own unique challenges. But be careful! You have a limited number of actions.</strong><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>\u2666 4 Worlds <br>\u2666 Well-crafted puzzles<br>\u2666 40 Levels<br>\u2666 Varieties of traps<br>\u2666 original soundtrack",
